# pyenv
#   For a library or package, you might want to ignore these files since the Python version is
#   managed by the user of the library or package. For a service or application, it is recommended
#   to check these files into version control.
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#1198, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if delegates have different system requirements, they may
#   wish to lock on their own.
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, it is generally recommended to include poetry.lock in version control.
#poetry.lock

